  era: "6th\u20139th c. CE \xB7 Section 15 \xB7 Bhakti and Sufi Movements \xB7 c. 6th \u2013 17th century"
  title: Nayanars
  text: The sixty-three Nayanars were Tamil saints devoted to Shiva. Their hymns form the Tevaram. Saints such as Appar, Sambandar and Sundarar came from different castes, and Karaikkal Ammaiyar was a woman saint.
